# Render-feature survey (reports/render-features): two fixed spots at noon, the game's camera behind the hero.
# Per spot: settle 6 s, shot <spot>_a, 20 s of normal frames (the timed window), shot <spot>,
# 3 s of synchronous capture frames (rec; the runner drops the video), then a night shot.
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_SHOP01_FRONT_03
face 0
cam game
wait 6000
shot city_a
wait 20000
shot city
wait 300
rec city_cap
wait 3000
stop
set time 23 0
wait 3000
shot city_night
wait 100
set time 12 0
goto NW_FARM1_OUT_01
face 90
cam game
wait 6000
shot farm_a
wait 20000
shot farm
wait 300
rec farm_cap
wait 3000
stop
set time 23 0
wait 3000
shot farm_night
wait 500
